{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"曾经熟悉的亲近感忽然回来，可眼下仍过不上那种生活，他还没想明白，身体已经先紧起来。\",\n      \"key\": \"亲近感忽然回来\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他当初不肯再等，是不想看着珍惜的东西继续受损，光在心里怀念也护不住它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯再等\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想重新振作，却怕一急着争取又只顾硬撑，连刚找回的亲近也顾不上，光说不能再等也催不动自己。\",\n      \"key\": \"刚找回的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"失效\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安宁真实却让未实现的愿望重新显眼这一因果，改成曾经熟悉的亲近感回来后，现实中的缺口撞到眼前，身体先于念头作出反应。既解释突然惊醒，也让熟悉感为何加深失去感有了依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象反问和回想最初决定合成他自己的念头，保留不愿看着珍惜之物继续受损、不能只靠怀念的行动理由。由真实的生活缺口引出当初的决定，不再先讲道理再补回忆。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [],\n      \"what\": \"删除\",\n      \"why\": \"对刚才沉浸于满足的自责重复了R32的落差，却没有带来新的心理原因。珠子也没有支持他把短暂享受安宁当成过错，删除后不损失行动与依恋的冲突。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\", \"R38\", \"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他想重新振作却怕再次逼自己硬撑、争取时顾不上刚找回的亲近，以及原来的行动理由已不足以压住顾虑。把R38的对称两难并入具体的行动恐惧，并将R39落到旧理由为何不再足以推动他，不另写重复的总结句。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3e77a859-5f1f-4ee0-8d74-5920cf3ad787", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T081901114967Z", "elapsed_seconds": 931.875, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T08:34:33.021845+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8ce7fc34b4a8756962c182e341eac2136cb70881c73a5373ad2f2557784d4c6a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "t